{"term":{"label":"心","occurrences":30,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"2A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-i","title":"公孫丑上","description":"公孫丑問曰：「夫子當路於齊，管仲、晏子之功，可復許乎？」\n孟子曰：「子誠齊人也，知管仲、晏子而已矣。或問乎曾西曰：『吾子與子路孰賢？』曾西蹴然曰：『吾先子之所畏也。』曰：『然則吾子與管仲孰賢？』曾西艴然不悅，曰：『爾何曾比予於管仲？管仲得君，如彼其專也；行乎國政，如彼其久也；功烈，如彼其卑也。爾何曾比予於是？』」曰：「"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"動","id":"動"},{"form":"勿","id":"勿"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"忍","id":"忍"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"智","id":"智"},{"form":"服","id":"服"},{"form":"求","id":"求"},{"form":"生","id":"生"},{"form":"端","id":"端"},{"form":"聞","id":"聞"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"辭","id":"辭"},{"form":"道","id":"道"}],"edges":[{"weight":1.6376087894007967,"source":"端","target":"心"},{"weight":1.0245043165143877,"source":"端","target":"惡"},{"weight":1.4299694246225523,"source":"端","target":"辭"},{"weight":2.1231166051824975,"source":"端","target":"智"},{"weight":1.1245877750713704,"source":"人","target":"智"},{"weight":0.8622235106038793,"source":"人","target":"心"},{"weight":1.4122698475231514,"source":"人","target":"服"},{"weight":1.8177349556313156,"source":"人","target":"忍"},{"weight":0.9422662182774157,"source":"人","target":"惡"},{"weight":1.9095425048844386,"source":"動","target":"心"},{"weight":1.766441661243765,"source":"動","target":"道"},{"weight":1.989585212557975,"source":"動","target":"聞"},{"weight":1.5841201044498106,"source":"動","target":"反"},{"weight":1.791759469228055,"source":"服","target":"心"},{"weight":0.4054651081081644,"source":"生","target":"心"},{"weight":1.3609765531356006,"source":"行","target":"道"},{"weight":0.4054651081081644,"source":"行","target":"心"},{"weight":1.3609765531356006,"source":"行","target":"忍"},{"weight":1.9740810260220096,"source":"忍","target":"心"},{"weight":0.8109302162163288,"source":"聞","target":"心"},{"weight":0.8109302162163288,"source":"智","target":"心"},{"weight":0.8109302162163288,"source":"辭","target":"心"},{"weight":0.810930216216328